   "body": "/claim cloud/fb-quickwins-sonnet\n\nPlan (cloud/orch's instruction, after #1132):\n- Remove the refresh button from `TopicListView`'s trailing toolbar group (every list it serves: Favoris, Drapeaux, category lists); the `.refreshable` pull stays untouched. `ToolbarRefreshIcon` stays for the screens that still use it (checking which share the component: MP list, Alertes Qualitay, profile).\n- Title pill: leave the system's own centring of the principal item (no custom layout); say in the PR what the screenshot would show.\n- Test first: a hosted bar test pinning the trailing items of a category list, red on today's code (one trailing item), green after.\n- Ledger `gap-edit` (deliberate difference from legacy and #770), draft PR with `compile-check`, Opus review, ready line on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
